[{"client_msg_id":"4430e334-8978-41ec-a2be-9fe1478079d6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"大抵の場合はそれでもうまく行くとは思いますし、現実問題としては気にしなくても大丈夫なのもわかるんですが、イレギュラーケースとして例えば `--work-dir --local-bin-path` (`--work-dir` の値としての `--local-bin-path`)みたいな引数がないとも言い切れないんですよね","ts":"1619859630.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=1v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9332e6dc-38e8-418c-be2f-dbdef2d453fe","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"```exec $stack_path/stack --stack-root \"$stack_root\" --local-bin-path \"$local_bin\" --compiler \"ghc-$version\" \\$*```\nって、$* でそのまま渡しちゃってるだけだから、echo $* | grep -q  '--local-bin-path ' で分岐させて --local-bin-path \"$local_bin\" を含めないで exec みたいな雑な処理で良いのではないかなあ。","ts":"1619859431.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+bJOT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c809d3c-66b1-4922-9f34-f06512ab0160","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それをやるには `stack` がどう引数を解釈するかを完全に理解しないといけないんですよねぇ。オプション引数でも単体のものとパラメータを取るものがあったりするし","ts":"1619858968.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a9410f3-3706-4c0c-8cd3-b61c52f33a1d","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"asdf の stack の shell script を変更するのであれば、 --local-bin-path が引数に含まれてるかどうか調べて、含まれてる場合と含まれてない場合で exec するときの処理を分ければ良いだけな気がする。","ts":"1619858760.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D6TC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7443bb9-6a36-42cd-95c9-90ba111f8daf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"同じところで詰まって識者の意見を聞きたく… vim-jp で Haskeller って誰かいますかね。 \u003c@U7D5LRRQD\u003e さん? (最近見かけないけど)","ts":"1619847928.010100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bpB4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a3259e2-d61a-4347-b623-4ba3de2cd32c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"yamlの方でも制御はできそうですけど、asdfの管理下に設定ファイル置くのは正しいのか分からない……","ts":"1619847798.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eae20c90-6c3c-4005-8557-0f6d76d5ae60","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうなんですよねぇ。 STACK_ROOT はそれでもいけそうなんですけど local-bin が…","ts":"1619847611.009200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cMNL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4047966-38c1-4c0b-98f2-405445ca9673","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"rootに関しては環境変数の STACK_ROOT 使うようにすれば上書きもできそうですけど、local-binはそれっぽいのなさそう……","ts":"1619847533.008700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eD/8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93fd46be-0d6f-49fa-beb6-438622fce7a2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実行時です","ts":"1619847453.008600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1B7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec786cc1-bad1-44a7-96db-7350c97c9af1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"やりたいのはstack入れる時の変更でいいんですか？\nそれともstack実行時？","ts":"1619847431.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xEzyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75c9b9b6-3e11-4820-9e01-ac82e993d23e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`$ASDF_INSTALL_PATH` は asdf 本体がプラグインに渡すパラメータです。ユーザーが制御するものではないです。","ts":"1619847405.008200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wO9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17ab998e-9be2-4e11-80a6-2a5fc5110d93","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"分けたい、というかそいつらはデフォルトは全然別の場所ですね (`~/.stack` と `~/.local/bin`)","ts":"1619847268.007000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vqj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93cd4d91-7ae8-4a18-a8a8-1f5c28fba487","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`$ASDF_INSTALL_PATH` でちょっとは制御できそうですが、 `stack-root` と `local-bin-path` を分けたりしたいって感じですかね?","ts":"1619847019.006300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2jeQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1049fffc-ef00-4c15-8522-9711df26e3f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"asdf で Haskell 入れてるんですけど、これで入れた stack が Bash でラップされていて、こいつが `--stack-root` と `--local-bin-path` を指定してしまっていて、stack はどうも同じオプションを複数回指定して上書くようなことはできないみたいなんですよね。\nこのせいで `stack-root` と `local-bin-path` が一切変更できないので困ってるんですけど、修正 PR 出すにしてもどう直せばいいかがよくわからず、stack 詳しい人わかりませんかね…?\n\u003chttps://github.com/asdf-community/asdf-haskell/blob/master/bin/install#L51\u003e","ts":"1619846076.005000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: asdf-community/asdf-haskell","id":1,"title":"asdf-community/asdf-haskell","title_link":"https://github.com/asdf-community/asdf-haskell/blob/master/bin/install#L51","text":"Haskell plugin for the asdf version manager. Contribute to asdf-community/asdf-haskell development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/108921d10c9f71805a61774d5630eb1e82aada86d8853225006f948dd1017cc1/asdf-community/asdf-haskell","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/asdf-community/asdf-haskell/blob/master/bin/install#L51","original_url":"https://github.com/asdf-community/asdf-haskell/blob/master/bin/install#L51"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m6H"}]}]
